msgstr "路由表、router 策略、端点健康、熔断器、回退"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:18
msgid ""
"Both are importable as top-level packages (`serving.*`, `routing.*`); the"
" import root is `apps/backend`, declared in `pyproject.toml`."
msgstr ""
