"`pyproject.toml` 中声明。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:21
msgid "The four layers"
msgstr "四个层次"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:63
msgid ""
"For how a public deployment gets traffic *to* the gateway — reverse "
"proxy, CDN, and the console's own path rewrites — see [The public path "
"table](public-path-table.md). Nothing in this page depends on that "
"topology; the gateway is an ordinary HTTP server."
msgstr ""
"一个公开部署如何把流量送*到*网关——反向代理、CDN，以及控制台自己的路径重写——见[公网路径表](public-path-"
"table.md)。本页的内容不依赖那套拓扑；网关就是一台普通的 HTTP 服务器。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:68
msgid "Request lifecycle"
msgstr "请求生命周期"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:70
msgid ""
"The chat-completions path in "
"`apps/backend/serving/servers/routers/completions.py` is the canonical "
"one; the other inference surfaces reuse its parts."
msgstr ""
"`apps/backend/serving/servers/routers/completions.py` 里的 chat-completions"
" 路径是最典型的那一条；其他推理接口复用它的组成部分。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:74
msgid "1. Middleware"
msgstr "1\\. 中间件"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:76
msgid ""
"`create_app()` in `apps/backend/serving/servers/app.py` registers five "
"middlewares. Starlette runs the last-registered outermost, so the "
"effective order from the outside in is:"
msgstr ""
"`apps/backend/serving/servers/app.py` 中的 `create_app()` "
"注册了五个中间件。Starlette 把最后注册的跑在最外层，因此从外到内的实际顺序是："

#: ../developer/architecture.md:80
msgid ""
"`RequestIdMiddleware` — mints or adopts a request id used by every log "
"line."
msgstr "`RequestIdMiddleware`——生成或沿用一个请求 id，每一行日志都带着它。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:81
msgid "`FallbackErrorMiddleware` — last-resort error shaping."
msgstr "`FallbackErrorMiddleware`——兜底的错误整形。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:82
msgid "`RequestLogMiddleware` — one structured log record per HTTP request."
msgstr "`RequestLogMiddleware`——每个 HTTP 请求一条结构化日志记录。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:83
msgid ""
"`TimeoutMiddleware` — `REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS` (default 120s) for "
"ordinary requests, `STREAM_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS` (default 3600s, `<=0`"
" disables the cap) once a response has been marked as streaming."
msgstr ""
"`TimeoutMiddleware`——普通请求用 `REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`（默认 "
"120s）；响应一旦被标记为流式，就改用 `STREAM_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`（默认 3600s，`<=0` "
"表示取消该上限）。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:86
msgid "`CORSMiddleware`."
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/architecture.md:88
msgid ""
"Middleware order is load-bearing: streaming responses are "
"`StreamingResponse` objects that must not be buffered. Any new middleware"
" that reads a response body before forwarding it will break Server-Sent "
"Events."
msgstr ""
"中间件的顺序是承重的：流式响应是 `StreamingResponse` 对象，绝不能被缓冲。任何在转发之前读取响应体的新中间件，都会破坏 "
"Server-Sent Events。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:92
msgid "2. Authentication and quota"
msgstr "2\\. 认证与配额"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:94
msgid ""
"`verify_api_key` in `apps/backend/serving/servers/auth.py` is a FastAPI "
"dependency on every inference endpoint. It resolves, in order:"
msgstr ""
"`apps/backend/serving/servers/auth.py` 中的 `verify_api_key` 是挂在每个推理端点上的 "
"FastAPI 依赖。它按以下顺序解析："

#: ../developer/architecture.md:97
msgid ""
"**Agent grant tokens** — a separate credential namespace, checked first. "
"A grant may only be used on inference paths; anything else gets `403 "
"insufficient_scope`."
msgstr ""
"**Agent grant token**——一个独立的凭据命名空间，最先检查。grant 只能用在推理路径上；用在别处会得到 `403 "
"insufficient_scope`。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:100
msgid ""
"**Auth disabled** — when `USER_AUTH_ENABLED` is falsy the caller is "
"treated as an anonymous admin. The setting is fail-closed: auth is on "
"unless explicitly turned off."
msgstr ""
"**认证关闭**——当 `USER_AUTH_ENABLED` 为假值时，调用方被当作匿名管理员。这个开关是 fail-closed "
"的：除非显式关掉，否则认证始终开启。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:103
msgid ""
"**API key** — keys are minted as `hyi-<url-safe token>` and stored only "
"as an HMAC-SHA256 digest keyed by `API_KEY_SECRET`. The key may arrive as"
" `Authorization: Bearer …` or `X-API-Key`."
msgstr ""
"**API key**——key 以 `hyi-<url-safe token>` 的形式签发，只以 `API_KEY_SECRET` 为密钥的 "
"HMAC-SHA256 digest 形式存储。key 可以通过 `Authorization: Bearer …` 或 `X-API-Key` "
"传入。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:107
msgid ""
"The same dependency enforces the caller's daily spend quota and returns "
"`429` with a shared payload builder (`apps/backend/serving/quota.py`) "
"whichever door the request came through. A separate "
"`enforce_user_concurrency` dependency holds a per-user in-flight slot for"
" the duration of the request."
msgstr ""
"同一个依赖还会执行调用方的每日消费配额；无论请求从哪扇门进来，都由同一个 payload "
"构造器（`apps/backend/serving/quota.py`）返回 `429`。另有一个 "
"`enforce_user_concurrency` 依赖，在请求持续期间为每个用户占住一个在途槽位。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:112
msgid ""
"Read-only endpoints such as `/v1/models` use `optional_verify_api_key` "
"instead: a missing or invalid key is anonymous rather than rejected, and "
"the key only decides which models are visible."
msgstr ""
"像 `/v1/models` 这样的只读端点改用 `optional_verify_api_key`：key "
"缺失或无效时按匿名处理而不是拒绝，key 只决定哪些模型可见。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:116
msgid "3. Model gate"
msgstr "3\\. 模型门禁"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:118
msgid ""
"Before any provider is contacted, the handler rejects the request with "
"`404` if the model is not in the route table, is unpublished, requires a "
"role the caller does not have, was disabled for that user, or is outside "
"a grant's scope. All five conditions return the same \"model not found\" "
"body on purpose, so a caller cannot enumerate models it is not entitled "
"to by reading the difference between `403` and `404`."
msgstr ""
"在联系任何 provider 之前，如果模型不在路由表里、未发布、要求调用方不具备的角色、对该用户被禁用，或者落在某个 grant "
"的范围之外，处理器就会以 `404` 拒绝请求。这五种情况故意返回同一个 \"model not found\" 响应体，这样调用方就无法靠 "
"`403` 与 `404` 的差异，枚举出自己无权访问的模型。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:125
msgid "4. Router selection"
msgstr "4\\. router 选择"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:127
msgid ""
"Each model resolves to a router instance through `ModelRouterRegistry` "
"(`apps/backend/routing/model_router_registry.py`), which reads the "
"model's `router:` / `router_params:` fields from the model registry and "
"caches one router per model id. A model with no `router:` uses the "
"`default_router` value from the routing config."
msgstr ""
"每个模型通过 "
"`ModelRouterRegistry`（`apps/backend/routing/model_router_registry.py`）解析到一个"
" router 实例；它从模型注册表读取该模型的 `router:` / `router_params:` 字段，并为每个模型 id 缓存一个 "
"router。没有写 `router:` 的模型使用路由配置中的 `default_router` 值。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:133
msgid ""
"The router then picks one adapter for this request "
"(`FixedRouter._select_adapter`):"
msgstr "接着 router 为这次请求挑选一个 adapter（`FixedRouter._select_adapter`）："

#: ../developer/architecture.md:135
msgid "routes whose provider is admin-disabled carry weight 0 and are skipped;"
msgstr "provider 被管理员禁用的路由权重为 0，会被跳过；"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:136
msgid ""
"routes whose input modalities cannot accept the request's media are "
"excluded;"
msgstr "输入模态无法接收该请求所带媒体的路由被排除；"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:137
msgid ""
"routes whose circuit is open are not admitted — if that leaves nothing, "
"the request fails with `AllCircuitsOpenError`;"
msgstr "熔断器处于打开状态的路由不予准入——如果这样一条都不剩，请求以 `AllCircuitsOpenError` 失败；"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:139
msgid ""
"among the survivors, selection is weighted-random, biased away from "
"endpoints already saturated with prefill work;"
msgstr "在幸存的路由中按权重随机选择，并有意避开已经被 prefill 工作压满的端点；"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:141
msgid ""
"a short-lived per-caller affinity (5 minutes) re-pins a conversation to "
"the endpoint that already holds its prefix cache, unless that endpoint "
"has built up a backlog."
msgstr "一条按调用方划分的短期亲和性（5 分钟）会把一段对话重新钉回已经持有它前缀缓存的端点，除非那个端点已经积压了任务。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:145
msgid ""
"An admin may bypass selection entirely with an `X-Route-Pin` request "
"header naming a provider label or `endpoint_id`. A pinned request never "
"falls back — a silent switch would make the pin meaningless."
msgstr ""
"管理员可以用 `X-Route-Pin` 请求头点名一个 provider 标签或 "
"`endpoint_id`，从而完全跳过选择。被钉住的请求永远不会回退——悄悄换一个端点会让钉选失去意义。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:149
msgid "5. Dispatch, fallback, and the circuit breaker"
msgstr "5\\. 分发、回退与熔断器"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:151
msgid "`FixedRouter.chat_completion` / `stream_chat_completion` call the chosen adapter. The call itself goes through the execution boundary: the router binds the adapter it selected into an `EndpointBinding` and a `LeafBackend` runs that adapter, so nothing is re-resolved between the decision and the call. The router keeps the admission claim, the prefill lease, the attempt history and the `_routing` metadata; the leaf keeps none of them. See [Leaves, pools, and dispatch instructions](routing.md#leaves-pools-and-dispatch-instructions)."
msgstr ""
"`FixedRouter.chat_completion` / `stream_chat_completion` 调用选中的 "
"adapter。这次调用本身经由执行边界：router 把它选中的 adapter 绑进一个 `EndpointBinding`，由 "
"`LeafBackend` 执行该 adapter，因此在决策与调用之间不会再解析一次目标。准入凭据、prefill 租约、尝试历史和 "
"`_routing` 元数据都留在 router 上；叶子一样都不保留。见[叶子、池与派发指令](routing.md#leaves-pools-and"
"-dispatch-instructions)。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:159
msgid "On success the endpoint is recorded healthy and the response carries an internal `_routing` block (provider, base URL, `endpoint_id`)."
msgstr "成功时该端点被记为健康，响应里带上一个内部的 `_routing` 块（provider、base URL、`endpoint_id`）。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:162
msgid ""
"On failure the endpoint records a failure and — unless the caller pinned "
"a provider — the router walks the model's remaining route legs in route "
"order, skipping legs that are disabled, modality-incompatible, or "
"circuit-open, and tries each in turn. Every attempt is appended to a "
"`failed_attempts` list that travels with the eventual response or error, "
"so the request log attributes the failure to real upstreams rather than "
"to the router. If every leg fails, the *primary* error is re-raised."
msgstr ""
"失败时该端点记下一次失败，并且——除非调用方钉住了某个 provider——router "
"会按路由顺序遍历该模型剩下的路由分支，跳过被禁用的、模态不兼容的、以及熔断器打开的分支，逐个尝试。每次尝试都会追加进一个 "
"`failed_attempts` 列表，这个列表随最终的响应或错误一起传出，因此请求日志会把失败归因到真实的上游，而不是归给 "
"router。如果每条分支都失败，则重新抛出*最初*那个错误。"

